WEBVTT

00:00:18.440 --> 00:00:25.620
They'll spend a billion on a missile in a day.

00:00:25.920 --> 00:00:34.930
They'll spend a billion on a missile in a day.

00:00:35.230 --> 00:00:50.670
But ask for forest research — watch the money walk away.

00:00:50.970 --> 00:00:59.950
The mycel feeds the roots that feed the grain that feeds us all.

00:01:00.250 --> 00:01:08.580
The mycel feeds the roots that feed the grain that feeds us all.

00:01:08.880 --> 00:01:26.060
But nobody funds the ground until the harvest starts to fall.

00:01:26.360 --> 00:01:34.580
A healthy soil can feed a nation, clean the water, hold the rain.

00:01:34.880 --> 00:01:43.380
A healthy soil can feed a nation, clean the water, hold the rain.

00:01:43.680 --> 00:01:59.840
But science begs for crumbs while tanks roll down the lane.

00:02:00.140 --> 00:02:04.080
They say the budget's tight, they say we have to choose.

00:02:04.380 --> 00:02:16.100
They say the budget's tight, they say we have to choose.

00:02:16.400 --> 00:02:29.380
But you can't eat a weapon when the topsoil's blown its fuse.

00:02:29.680 --> 00:02:31.510
Who speaks for the forest?

00:02:31.810 --> 00:02:32.900
Nobody in the hall.

00:02:33.200 --> 00:02:34.870
Who speaks for the mycel?

00:02:35.170 --> 00:02:36.940
Nobody at all.

00:02:37.240 --> 00:02:40.940
Who's gonna feed us when the last good soil is gone?

00:02:41.240 --> 00:03:19.320
Lord, we've been singing this too long.

00:03:19.620 --> 00:03:27.650
The oldest network on this earth asks nothing but a chance.

00:03:27.950 --> 00:03:36.360
The oldest network on this earth asks nothing but a chance.

00:03:36.660 --> 00:03:40.070
We're running out of time to learn its language and its dance.

